  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Hard miss: key never cached",
      "items": [
        "getCacheEntry returns no entry and nothing fetches: no read-through (data-cache-service.ts:42-45)",
        "Only upsertCacheEntry writes, and only the scheduler calls it (sync-scheduler.ts:61)",
        "markStale touches existing entries only, so a never-cached key stays empty (data-cache-service.ts:128, :396)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Soft miss and manual refresh",
      "items": [
        "Expired entries are flagged on read and still returned; the checker flips fresh → stale every 60 s (service:47-51, :379-390)",
        "TTL: vitals 2 h, labs 4 h, meds 8 h, claims/imaging 12 h, else 24 h (service:10-21)",
        "POST /cache/refresh marks stale and fakes completion in 3-5 s; entries turn fresh only on the 5-min sweep (routes.ts:65-93, scheduler:16)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Simulated, and not on this path",
      "items": [
        "Sweep fetch and health checks are Math.random, not FHIR, Blue Button, or Fasten calls (scheduler:57-58, :115-116)",
        "Object storage only issues upload URLs; no Postgres table backs this cache, so state dies on restart (routes.ts:184, service:24-26)",
        "Wiring: server/routes.ts:852 and :864; types shared/schema.ts:21879-21935"
      ]
    }
  ]
